[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0010","text":"……！\n天气超好的～☆"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0020","text":"喂喂甜花酱！\n今天天气超晴朗的哦～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0030","text":"嗯……！\n暖洋洋的，适合午睡……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0040","text":"不是啦～！\n偶尔也出去走走吧～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0050","text":"诶……\n不要……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0060","text":"……那，跟甘奈猜拳！\n甘奈赢了就出门！　好吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0070","text":"…………\n好、好吧……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0080","text":"猜拳──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0090","text":"嘿嘿……\n小甜……怎么样……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_31400300_01_0100","text":"嗯……\n确实……暖洋洋的，好舒服呢～……"}]
